{
  "id": "05-data-agent-walkthrough",
  "title": "Ask Fabric data questions in plain English",
  "duration": 41.5147,
  "beats": [
    {
      "text": "Your Power BI semantic model can also be a source for a Fabric data agent.",
      "asset": "agent-create",
      "device": "tile",
      "key": "Data agent",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.7253,
      "voice_end": 4.5653
    },
    {
      "text": "Microsoft's documented setup starts by creating the agent and choosing its data sources.",
      "asset": "agent-create",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 4.7253,
      "end": 10.4107,
      "voice_end": 10.2507
    },
    {
      "text": "You can add up to five supported sources in one agent.",
      "asset": "agent-sources",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 10.4107,
      "end": 13.6,
      "voice_end": 13.44
    },
    {
      "text": "Select the tables it should use. Give columns and tables descriptive names.",
      "asset": "agent-select",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 13.6,
      "end": 18.0693,
      "voice_end": 17.9093
    },
    {
      "text": "Then ask a concrete question. For example, what were total sales in California in twenty twenty three?",
      "asset": "agent-ask",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 18.0693,
      "end": 24.2453,
      "voice_end": 24.0853
    },
    {
      "text": "The agent can generate SQL, DAX or KQL, depending on the data source.",
      "asset": "agent-ask",
      "device": "sequence",
      "start": 24.2453,
      "end": 29.312,
      "voice_end": 29.152
    },
    {
      "text": "It uses your data access permissions. Clear descriptions and a clean model help it choose the right query.",
      "asset": "agent-sources",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 29.312,
      "end": 35.1253,
      "voice_end": 34.9653
    },
    {
      "text": "Before a real demo, check capacity prerequisites, permissions, and the generated query against a known answer.",
      "asset": "agent-ask",
      "device": "focus",
      "start": 35.1253,
      "end": 41.5147,
      "voice_end": 41.3547
    }
  ],
